OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fthicken from the south during this
OL,7,Fevening with a chance of showers
OL,8,Fbreaking out overnight, some perhaps
OL,9,Fheavy. Becoming generally dry later
OL,10,Fthough with the cloud breaking up. A
OL,11,Fwarm and humid night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FGenerally fine with some very
OL,14,Fwarm spells of sunshine developing
OL,15,Fduring the morning. However, as cloud
OL,16,Fincreases heading into the afternoon
OL,17,Fone or two showers are possible.
OL,18,FLocally hot still.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
