OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday will be less warm and breezy
OL,7,Fwith sunshine and scattered showers.
OL,8,FBecoming drier and less breezy to end
OL,9,Fthe week with some more prolonged
OL,10,Fspells of sunshine, though fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
